      "id": "FAM:SF-APPA-001",
      "status_as_recorded": "artifact",
      "finding": "A1 adapter PPP lift (+0.0667 for adapters vs +0.1260 for no_signal) was not a real coverage response; wrong-way teams did not do worse, confidence did not increase gap, and carryover was absent—all pointing to construction/labeling artifact."
