      {
        "code": "SAMPLE_SIZE_POWER",
        "text": "Within-unit sample sizes of failed-PNR-then-pull-up sequences are likely small, leading to imprecise lift estimates and low power to classify 70% of units as having lift>0 or to estimate median lift with acceptable error."
